---
import '../styles/global.css';
import '../styles/overrides.css';
import '../styles/grace.css';
import '../styles/about-three.css';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content="About GAS — the people behind Halloparty 26." />
    <link rel="icon" href={`${base}favicon.svg`} type="image/svg+xml" />
    <title>About GAS — Halloparty 26</title>
  </head>
  <body class="about-page">
    <div class="grain"></div>
    <header class="site-header wrap"><a class="brand" href={base} aria-label="Halloparty 26 home">GAS</a><nav><a href={`${base}#details`}>The plan</a><a href={`${base}#rsvp`}>RSVP</a></nav></header>
    <main class="about wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">The people behind it</p>
      <h1>About <em>GAS.</em></h1>
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="polaroids" aria-label="Grace and Manuja">
          <figure class="polaroid grace-card"><div class="grace-photo"><img src={`${base}grace.png`} alt="Grace in costume" /></div><figcaption>Grace <b>←</b></figcaption></figure>
          <figure class="polaroid manuja-card"><div class="manuja-photo"><img src={`${base}manuja.png`} alt="Manuja in costume" /></div><figcaption><b>→</b> Manuja</figcaption></figure>
          <figure class="polaroid friends-card"><div class="friends-photo"><img src={`${base}gas-friends.jpg`} alt="Grace and Manuja together" /></div><figcaption>Grace + Manuja <b>♡</b></figcaption></figure>
        </div>
        <div class="about-copy"><p>Giggles &amp; Shitz Productions started when Grace and Manuja were bored at UTS and decided to make a podcast. It quickly became an ongoing excuse to make things, dress up and take a good idea much further than necessary.</p><p>Since then, they have stayed committed to the giggles, the shitz and their loyal fan base. This year: <b>Halloparty 26</b>, their biggest production yet.</p><a class="button button-orange" href={`${base}#rsvp`}>RSVP to Halloparty 26 <span>→</span></a></div>
      </div>
    </main>
    <footer><img src={`${base}giggles-shitz-wordmark.svg`} alt="Giggles and Shitz" /><p>Halloparty 26 · A GAS production</p></footer>
  </body>
</html>
